{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs34 NOTICE\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Independent Project\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 {\b BigCityLegacy} is an independent, unofficial compatibility and preservation project for the discontinued PC version of {\b MadOut2 BigCityOnline} that was distributed through Steam.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 BigCityLegacy is not an official product of the developers or rightsholders of MadOut2. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, supported by, authorized by, or endorsed by them.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 References to MadOut2, MadOut2 BigCityOnline, Steam, and other names, trademarks, or identifiers are made solely for informational purposes and to identify compatible software and platforms.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 All rights in the original MadOut2 BigCityOnline game, including its software code, graphics, audio, game assets, trademarks, and other intellectual property, remain with their respective rightsholders.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 What BigCityLegacy Contains\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 BigCityLegacy contains only original project code and third-party components distributed under their respective licenses.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The Project does not distribute and is not intended to distribute:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} original game executables;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} {\f1 \fs24 Assembly-CSharp.dll} or other game libraries;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} game assets, models, textures, audio, resources, or other game files;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} original or decompiled source code of the game;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} original proprietary server software;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} Steam keys, product license keys, credentials, or other means of obtaining access to the game;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab \bullet \tab} software intended to bypass license verification, authentication, or purchase verification.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 To use BigCityLegacy, the user must independently possess their own compatible copy of the PC version of the game.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Supported Game Copy\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 BigCityLegacy is intended solely for use with a supported Steam version of the game that the user lawfully obtained and is entitled to use.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Official BigCityLegacy releases may verify the integrity and version of certain local game files, including through cryptographic hashes. Such verification is performed solely to identify compatible builds and detect modified or unsupported files.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 BigCityLegacy grants no rights to the original game and is not a means of obtaining the game.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Obsolete AlwaysOnline Mechanism\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The supported PC release contains an obsolete dependency on an external AlwaysOnline service under which the client sends a simple network request and expects a service-availability response. This mechanism does not itself authenticate the user, verify a Steam license, validate in-game purchases, or issue an authenticated user session.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Following discontinuation of that service, the absence of a response prevents the client from starting, including access to local gameplay modes.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 BigCityLegacy may alter this behavior for compatibility with the discontinued client and to restore its ability to start without the unavailable network dependency.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This functionality is not intended to bypass authentication, licensing, DRM, purchase verification, or other access-control mechanisms.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Network Functionality\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 BigCityLegacy may provide independently implemented compatible network infrastructure for the discontinued PC version of the game.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 BigCityLegacy is not intended to connect to, interfere with, or obtain unauthorized access to current official MadOut2 services, servers, accounts, user data, purchases, or in-game economy systems.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The Project is not compatible with the current mobile version of MadOut2 and is not intended to bypass or replace its authentication, session-validation, or purchase-verification systems.\par}
{\pard \qc \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\emdash\par}
